{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54079","headline":"句 · 李频","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恩深转无语，怀抱自分明。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十三王梦简《进士王氏诗要格律》）（按：原署「李颖」，收二联，另一联「天下已归汉，山中犹避秦」，爲李频《四皓庙》句，知此二句亦爲李频诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}